    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> is a unique blend of action-RTS and shoot'em up elements, where you embark on a journey to find the missing Polly, joined by a loyal team of sheep. Progress through levels, face new challenges, and overcome dangers to get closer to uncovering Polly's whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polly's Gone</i> offers two exciting game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.poster.avif?t=1737575053\" width=640 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.webm?t=1737575053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/5db964a65f3099a30c5c5fd6f0900205.mp4?t=1737575053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Dive into the story and explore various levels while tactically guiding your team and defeating enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.poster.avif?t=1737575053\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.webm?t=1737575053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358030/extras/f1124332f4b935304b3fd9a2853f2b8c.mp4?t=1737575053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode</strong>: Test your skills in a challenging 10-minute survival arena on a lost island, where your team\u2019s fate rests in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for dynamic battles, unique environments, and thrilling challenges in this action-packed adventure!</p>",
